{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>QRCode++ 是一款功能全面的 QR Code 生成器，讓你輕鬆建立數碼名片、WiFi 分享、位置追蹤等實用功能，適合商務人士及一般用戶。目前正進行限時免費，原價 US $3.99，抓緊機會下載！</p>\n\n<h2>一鍵生成多種 QR Code</h2>\n<p>QRCode++ 提供多種實用功能：即時建立數碼名片，可透過電郵或訊息分享；WiFi QR Code 生成器讓訪客無需密碼即可連線，保障網絡安全；位置追蹤功能方便旅遊時掌握行程；另設空氣質素及紫外線指數追蹤，關注健康；支援 9 種語言，並每日提供勵志語錄，助你保持動力。程式無廣告、無內購、無訂閱，一次付費終身使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-871-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-872-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-873-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-874-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-875-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-876-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：QRCode++</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T00:57:59.691541+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}